---
const eventDate = new Date('2026-11-06T19:00:00-05:00');
const phone = '573246683878';
const whatsappMessage = encodeURIComponent('Hola, confirmo mi asistencia a los XV años de Sara Valentina.');
const calendarUrl = 'https://calendar.google.com/calendar/render?action=TEMPLATE&text=' + encodeURIComponent('XV años de Sara Valentina') + '&dates=20261106T190000/20261107T020000&details=' + encodeURIComponent('Celebración de los XV años de Sara Valentina Motta Álvarez') + '&location=' + encodeURIComponent('Lugar por confirmar');
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
  <head><meta charset="UTF-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" /><meta name="theme-color" content="#0b0a0b" /><meta name="description" content="Invitación a los XV años de Sara Valentina Motta Álvarez · 6 de noviembre de 2026." /><title>Mis XV · Sara Valentina</title></head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <section class="hero" id="inicio"><div class="hero-border" aria-hidden="true"><span>✦</span><span>✦</span></div><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Una celebración para recordar</p><p class="hero-kicker">Mis</p><h1><span>XV</span><em>Sara<br />Valentina</em></h1><div class="hero-mark" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><b>✦</b><i></i></div><p class="hero-date">06 · 11 · 2026</p><a class="hero-link" href="#carta">Abrir la invitación <span>↓</span></a></div><p class="hero-side" aria-hidden="true">Motta Álvarez · 2026</p></section>
      <section class="letter section" id="carta"><div class="section-number">01 <span>carta</span></div><div class="letter-grid"><div class="letter-heading"><p class="eyebrow blush">Con cariño</p><h2>Hay días que<br />se vuelven<br /><em>recuerdo.</em></h2></div><div class="letter-copy"><p>Mis XV años son el comienzo de una nueva etapa y quiero compartir esta noche tan especial con las personas que hacen mi vida más bonita.</p><p>Será una alegría contar contigo para celebrar, brindar y guardar juntos un recuerdo para siempre.</p><p class="signature">Con amor,<br /><strong>Sara Valentina</strong></p></div></div><div class="letter-rule" aria-hidden="true">✦</div></section>
      <section class="portrait section"><div class="portrait-image"><img src="/sara-valentina.jpeg" alt="Retrato de Sara Valentina" loading="lazy" /><span class="portrait-stamp">SV<br /><small>XV</small></span></div><div class="portrait-copy"><p class="eyebrow blush">Una nueva etapa</p><h2>La noche<br /><em>comienza aquí.</em></h2><p>Una fecha, una ilusión y todas las personas que quiero cerca para celebrarla.</p></div></section>
      <section class="date-section section" id="fecha"><div class="section-number">02 <span>la fecha</span></div><p class="eyebrow">Guarda este día</p><div class="date-display"><span>Viernes</span><strong>06</strong><span>Noviembre · 2026</span></div><div class="time-line"><span>Recepción</span><b>7:00</b><span>de la noche</span></div><div class="countdown" data-countdown data-target={eventDate.toISOString()} aria-label="Cuenta regresiva"><div><b data-days>00</b><span>días</span></div><div><b data-hours>00</b><span>horas</span></div><div><b data-minutes>00</b><span>minutos</span></div><div><b data-seconds>00</b><span>segundos</span></div></div><a class="calendar-link" href={calendarUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Agregar al calendario <span>↗</span></a></section>
      <section class="details section"><div class="section-number">03 <span>detalles</span></div><div class="details-heading"><p class="eyebrow blush">Para tener en cuenta</p><h2>Todo listo<br /><em>para celebrar.</em></h2></div><div class="detail-list"><article><span class="detail-index">01</span><div><h3>Recepción</h3><p>Lugar por confirmar.<br /><small>Pronto compartiremos todos los detalles.</small></p></div></article><article><span class="detail-index">02</span><div><h3>Código de vestuario</h3><p class="pending">Por definir</p></div></article><article><span class="detail-index">03</span><div><h3>Lluvia de sobres</h3><p>Tu presencia es mi mejor regalo.</p></div></article></div></section>
      <section class="closing section" id="confirmar"><div class="closing-orbit" aria-hidden="true">✦</div><p class="eyebrow">Será un honor</p><h2>¿Nos<br /><em>acompañas?</em></h2><p class="closing-copy">Confirma tu asistencia para compartir contigo esta noche inolvidable.</p><a class="confirm-button" href={`https://wa.me/${phone}?text=${whatsappMessage}`} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Confirmar asistencia <span>↗</span></a><p class="closing-name">Sara Valentina</p></section>
      <footer><span>✦</span><p>Sara Valentina Motta Álvarez · XV</p><span>✦</span></footer>
    </main>
    <div class="music-card" aria-label="Control de música"><span class="music-note" aria-hidden="true">♫</span><div><p>Música de fondo</p><strong>The Willow Maid · Erutan</strong></div><button type="button" class="music-button" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Reproducir música">▶</button></div><audio id="bg-music" preload="metadata" loop src="/the-willow-maid-erutan.mp3"></audio><button class="top" type="button" aria-label="Volver al inicio" onclick="window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'})">↑</button>
    <script is:inline>
      const countdown = document.querySelector('[data-countdown]'); const tick = () => { const diff = Math.max(0, new Date(countdown.dataset.target).getTime() - Date.now()); const values = [Math.floor(diff/86400000), Math.floor(diff/3600000)%24, Math.floor(diff/60000)%60, Math.floor(diff/1000)%60]; ['days','hours','minutes','seconds'].forEach((key,i) => document.querySelector(`[data-${key}]`).textContent = String(values[i]).padStart(2,'0')); }; tick(); setInterval(tick,1000);
      const audio = document.getElementById('bg-music'); const musicButton = document.querySelector('.music-button'); musicButton?.addEventListener('click', async () => { if (audio.paused) { try { await audio.play(); musicButton.textContent='❚❚'; musicButton.setAttribute('aria-pressed','true'); } catch {} } else { audio.pause(); musicButton.textContent='▶'; musicButton.setAttribute('aria-pressed','false'); } });
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
<style is:global>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400;1,500&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=Italianno&display=swap');
  :root{--ink:#0b0a0b;--ink-soft:#171214;--paper:#f6f0ed;--rose:#d39a9d;--rose-deep:#9c626b;--gold:#d8b777;--muted:#b8aaa8;--serif:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;--script:'Italianno',cursive;--sans:'DM Sans',Arial,sans-serif}*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0;background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);font-family:var(--sans)}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.section{position:relative;width:min(100% - 2rem,54rem);margin:1rem auto;border:1px solid #d8b7774d;overflow:hidden}.eyebrow{margin:0;color:var(--gold);font:600 .65rem/1 var(--sans);letter-spacing:.28em;text-transform:uppercase}.blush{color:var(--rose-deep)}.hero{min-height:calc(100svh - 2rem);display:grid;place-items:center;padding:3rem 2rem;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 42%,#3a2028 0,#181014 34%,#0b0a0b 70%);isolation:isolate}.hero:before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:1rem;background:url('/marco-referencia.jpeg') center/cover;opacity:.07;mix-blend-mode:screen;z-index:-1}.hero-border{position:absolute;inset:1.1rem;border:1px solid #d8b7779c;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;padding:0 .5rem;color:var(--gold)}.hero-border span:last-child{align-self:flex-end}.hero-copy{text-align:center;transform:translateY(-1rem)}.hero-kicker{margin:2.4rem 0 .3rem;color:var(--rose);font:400 clamp(2rem,5vw,3rem)/.8 var(--script)}h1{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:1rem;margin:0;color:var(--paper)}h1 span{font:500 clamp(6rem,18vw,11rem)/.75 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.08em;color:var(--rose-light)}h1 em{font:500 clamp(3rem,8vw,5.3rem)/.72 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.05em;text-align:left;color:var(--paper)}.hero-mark{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:.7rem;margin:2.4rem 0 1.1rem;color:var(--gold)}.hero-mark i{display:block;width:3.3rem;height:1px;background:var(--gold)}.hero-mark b{font-size:.8rem}.hero-date{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.35em}.hero-link{display:inline-flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.7rem;margin-top:3.6rem;color:var(--rose);font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase}.hero-link span{font-size:1.4rem;color:var(--gold)}.hero-side{position:absolute;right:1.7rem;top:50%;margin:0;writing-mode:vertical-rl;transform:translateY(-50%);color:#d8b77788;font-size:.58rem;letter-spacing:.25em;text-transform:uppercase}.letter{padding:clamp(5rem,10vw,8rem) clamp(1.5rem,8vw,5rem);background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink)}.section-number{position:absolute;top:1.5rem;right:1.7rem;color:#a8666d99;font-size:.58rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}.section-number span{color:#8b7774;margin-left:.3rem}.letter-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:clamp(2rem,8vw,6rem);align-items:end}.letter h2,.portrait h2,.details h2,.closing h2{font:500 clamp(3.4rem,7vw,6rem)/.78 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:1.7rem 0 0}.letter h2 em,.portrait h2 em,.details h2 em,.closing h2 em{color:var(--rose-deep);font-style:italic}.letter-copy{font:400 1.15rem/1.55 var(--serif);color:#675858}.letter-copy p{margin:0 0 1.2rem}.signature{margin-top:2.4rem!important;color:var(--rose-deep)}.signature strong{font:400 2.3rem var(--script)}.letter-rule{margin-top:5rem;text-align:center;color:var(--gold);font-size:1.1rem}.portrait{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:clamp(2rem,7vw,5rem);align-items:center;padding:clamp(3rem,8vw,5rem);background:var(--ink-soft)}.portrait-image{position:relative;max-width:23rem;aspect-ratio:4/5;border:1px solid var(--gold);padding:.5rem;transform:rotate(-3deg);margin:auto}.portrait-image:after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:1rem;border:1px solid #d8b77755;pointer-events:none}.portrait-image img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;filter:saturate(.72) sepia(.12) contrast(1.05)}.portrait-stamp{position:absolute;right:-1.1rem;bottom:1.5rem;display:grid;place-items:center;width:4.6rem;height:4.6rem;border:1px solid var(--gold);border-radius:50%;background:var(--ink);color:var(--gold);font:500 1rem var(--serif);text-align:center;line-height:.8;transform:rotate(8deg)}.portrait-stamp small{font:600 .55rem var(--sans);letter-spacing:.18em}.portrait-copy{padding-right:1rem}.portrait-copy>p:last-child{max-width:17rem;color:var(--muted);font:1.2rem/1.45 var(--serif)}.date-section{padding:clamp(5rem,11vw,8rem) 1.5rem;text-align:center;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#22161a,#0d0b0d)}.date-section .section-number,.details .section-number{color:#d8b77799}.date-section>.eyebrow{margin-bottom:1.3rem}.date-display{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center}.date-display span{color:var(--muted);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase}.date-display strong{margin:.9rem 0 .5rem;color:var(--rose-light);font:500 clamp(9rem,24vw,15rem)/.7 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.1em}.time-line{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:1rem;margin:2.4rem auto 3rem;padding:1rem 0;border-top:1px solid #d8b7777a;border-bottom:1px solid #d8b7777a;max-width:24rem}.time-line span{color:var(--muted);font-size:.62rem;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase}.time-line b{color:var(--gold);font:500 2.5rem var(--serif)}.countdown{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:clamp(.8rem,4vw,2.2rem);margin-bottom:2.5rem}.countdown div{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.4rem;min-width:3.5rem}.countdown b{color:var(--paper);font:500 2rem var(--serif)}.countdown span{color:var(--muted);font-size:.55rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}.calendar-link,.confirm-button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:1.2rem;padding:.9rem 1.25rem;border:1px solid var(--gold);font-size:.65rem;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;transition:background .25s,color .25s}.calendar-link:hover,.confirm-button:hover{background:var(--gold);color:var(--ink)}.details{padding:clamp(5rem,10vw,8rem) clamp(1.5rem,8vw,5rem);background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink)}.details-heading{text-align:right;margin-bottom:4rem}.details h2{margin-top:1.2rem}.details h2 em{color:var(--rose-deep)}.detail-list{border-top:1px solid #b9948d66}.detail-list article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:3.5rem 1fr;gap:1rem;padding:1.5rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #b9948d66}.detail-index{color:var(--rose-deep);font-size:.62rem;letter-spacing:.15em}.detail-list h3{margin:0 0 .4rem;font:500 2rem var(--serif)}.detail-list p{margin:0;color:#675858;font:1.1rem/1.3 var(--serif)}.detail-list small{font-size:.9rem;color:#8b7774}.detail-list .pending{color:var(--rose-deep);font:400 1.7rem var(--script)}.closing{min-height:34rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:5rem 1.5rem;text-align:center;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 35%,#39202a 0,#1a1115 36%,#0b0a0b 74%)}.closing-orbit{position:absolute;top:2.5rem;color:var(--gold);font-size:1.5rem}.closing h2{margin:1.7rem 0;color:var(--paper)}.closing h2 em{color:var(--rose)}.closing-copy{max-width:20rem;margin:0 0 2rem;color:var(--muted);font:1.15rem/1.4 var(--serif)}.confirm-button{background:var(--rose);border-color:var(--rose);color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}.closing-name{margin:2.5rem 0 0;color:var(--gold);font:400 2rem var(--script)}footer{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:1rem;padding:2rem 1rem 4rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:.62rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-align:center}footer span{color:var(--gold)}.music-card{position:fixed;left:1rem;bottom:1rem;z-index:5;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.7rem;max-width:min(21rem,calc(100vw - 5rem));padding:.65rem .75rem;border:1px solid #d8b77788;border-radius:999px;background:#100d0edd;backdrop-filter:blur(12px);box-shadow:0 .7rem 2rem #0006}.music-note{font-size:1.2rem;color:var(--rose)}.music-card p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.55rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase}.music-card strong{display:block;max-width:12rem;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--paper);font:1rem var(--serif)}.music-button{width:2rem;height:2rem;border:1px solid var(--gold);border-radius:50%;background:transparent;color:var(--gold);cursor:pointer;font-size:.65rem}.top{position:fixed;right:1rem;bottom:1rem;z-index:4;width:2.5rem;height:2.5rem;border:1px solid var(--gold);border-radius:50%;background:#111d;color:var(--gold);cursor:pointer;font-size:1.1rem}@media(max-width:720px){.hero{min-height:calc(100svh - 1rem);margin:.5rem auto}.hero:before{inset:.5rem}.hero-border{inset:.7rem}.hero-side{display:none}.hero-copy{transform:none}h1{gap:.6rem}h1 span{font-size:6.5rem}h1 em{font-size:3rem}.section{width:calc(100% - 1rem);margin:.5rem auto;border-radius:.5rem}.letter-grid,.portrait{grid-template-columns:1fr}.letter-copy{margin-top:1rem}.portrait{gap:3rem}.portrait-copy{padding:0;text-align:center}.portrait-copy>p:last-child{margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}.details-heading{text-align:left}.detail-list h3{font-size:1.8rem}.date-display strong{font-size:10rem}.music-card{left:.7rem;bottom:.7rem}.music-card strong{max-width:9rem}.top{right:.7rem;bottom:4.8rem}}
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}.calendar-link,.confirm-button{transition:none}}
</style>
